# Symbols nothing can reach, kept deliberately. Format: <symbol> <reason>
#
# An entry without a reason is indistinguishable from an oversight, and a stale
# entry reads as permission for something that is no longer there — the gate
# rejects both.

# Webhook subscription delivery is implemented but never triggered: the service
# is constructed and its management endpoints work, so a subscription can be
# created, listed and toggled, but no event source calls DeliverEvent. This is a
# feature that was never wired, not code that outlived its caller — deleting it
# would remove the only implementation. Tracked separately.
WebhookSubscriptionService.DeliverEvent      webhook delivery is implemented but no event source calls it
WebhookSubscriptionService.listForDelivery   reached only from DeliverEvent
WebhookSubscriptionService.deliverWithRetry  reached only from DeliverEvent
